    "description": {
      "content": "APIClarity is an open source API security and observability tool that analyzes API traffic to reconstruct OpenAPI specifications, detect shadow and zombie APIs, identify API differences and changes, and provide API security alerts. This is the REST API exposed by an APIClarity deployment.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: OpenClarity",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
